    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Some
    share-based awards were issued net of income taxes. The Company repurchased shares on the issuance date to remit as income taxes
    to the appropriate government revenue service agencies.</FONT></TD></TR>
